# The Road to Divadom (jeuno 97) for a level 49 Dancer (AF2_QUEST_LEVEL 50) with The Unfinished Waltz completed: the
# glue to the Glowing Pebbles at level 49 (check 1 fails: no section holds, so no trade handler and no zone-in event;
# the available section's own silence at level 75 is the main flow's), then Laila: the level alone fails check 1, not
# offered, the Waltz's 10134.
lists UpperJeuno/Laila/onTrigger JugnerForestS/Glowing_Pebbles/onTrade JugnerForestS/onZoneIn/1
char zone=JugnerForestS pos=99,6.4,442.6 job=DNC lvl=49
quest Jeuno.LakesideMinuet completed
quest Jeuno.TheUnfinishedWaltz completed
item BlockOfYagudoGlue
login
trade Glowing_Pebbles BlockOfYagudoGlue x1  # level 49: no section, nothing
warp -52.5,0,101 UpperJeuno
trigger Laila                           # level 49: no section; the Waltz's 10134
finish
